Such a striking composition but spoiled a bit by that slanted horizon. Such a pity. Also the frame doesn''t do anything positive for the image especially not on DPC Challenge. People here generally frown at images to which a frame has been added. Hanging it on a wall with a frame is a totally different matter.</td>', 'Such a striking composition but spoiled a bit by that slanted horizon. Such a pity. Also the frame doesn''t do anything positive for the image especially not on DPC Challenge. People here generally frown at images to which a frame has been added. Hanging it on a wall with a frame is a totally different matter.', '2024-10-21 06:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
