(7771287, 1290753, 99263, '<td valign="top">
"This to me is a wonderful pastoral scene". I have translated my original comment from Afrikaans to English as I just realised that the photographer and location are not who I at first surmised. I saw your entry in Highways and Byways just now and there was also an entry by the South African photographer I mistook your entry with so I realised that the "Spring Bliss" entry which is obviously taken at the same location as the "Road Home" entry could not be by the South African member. Your entries must have been taken somewhere in either Australia or America. I tend to think more likely Australia because of the sheep, the Cyprus trees and the style of the farmhouse and fencing all which are so similar to what we have here in many rural areas of South Africa hence my initial comment.</td>', '"This to me is a wonderful pastoral scene". I have translated my original comment from Afrikaans to English as I just realised that the photographer and location are not who I at first surmised. I saw your entry in Highways and Byways just now and there was also an entry by the South African photographer I mistook your entry with so I realised that the "Spring Bliss" entry which is obviously taken at the same location as the "Road Home" entry could not be by the South African member. Your entries must have been taken somewhere in either Australia or America. I tend to think more likely Australia because of the sheep, the Cyprus trees and the style of the farmhouse and fencing all which are so similar to what we have here in many rural areas of South Africa hence my initial comment.', '2024-10-21 11:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
