<table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bassbone:</b></div><hr/><i> nice use of slow shutter to give the smooth water - but the title does not seem to match the wave motion which comes across as timid </i></td></tr></table> Thanks yeah ok but tidal surge is not dependent on wave motion. Tidal ebb and flow happens even when there are no waves at all. But anyways...maybe I should have used the word flow or something instead of surge.</td>', 'Originally posted by bassbone: nice use of slow shutter to give the smooth water - but the title does not seem to match the wave motion which comes across as timid  Thanks yeah ok but tidal surge is not dependent on wave motion. Tidal ebb and flow happens even when there are no waves at all. But anyways...maybe I should have used the word flow or something instead of surge.', '2024-10-22 07:27:45.000000', NULL, 0),
